{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-056.md","record_count":5,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s056-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி...ராணி...என்ன இது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-056.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s056-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னை சாக விடுங்கள்...நான் இனிமேல் இந்த உலகத்தில் வாழ்ந்து பயனென்ன? நான் வாழ முடியாதவள்...வாழக் கூடாதவள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-056.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s056-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராணி, நான் வாழவைக்கிறேன். இந்தா பாரு! வாழ்க்கையிலே தோல்வியடைஞ்சவங்கெல்லாம்—தற்கொலை பண்ணிக்க ஆரம்பிச்சா...உலகத்திலே...முக்கால்வாசி ஜனத்தொகை எப்பவோ காலியா போயிருக்கும்...கவலைப்படாதே—","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-056.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s056-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-056.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s056-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s056","scene_ordinal":56,"transition_audit_id":"T056","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! வேண்டாம், நான் சொல்றதைக்கேளு...கதவை தாப்பாபோட்டுட்டு விஷம் சாப்பிட்டுவிட்டு செத்தது மாதிரி படுத்துகிட. பாக்கியை நான் பாத்துக்கிறேன்...உம்...உடனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":77,"printed_page":76}],"source_scene_file":"scene-056.md"}]}